{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "31", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "18", "M": "08", "S": "49"}}, "news": [{"title": "Over 270 Agartala slum residents get flats under affordable housing scheme", "para": "The Agartala Light House Project has delivered flat allotments to 278 lower-income families after an eight-year wait. This transformative initiative focuses on providing affordable housing in accordance with the GHTC-India scheme. The project features approximately 1,000 modern flats, constructed using innovative technologies for improved durability and efficiency, while also incorporating essential amenities like healthcare and community centers.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/over-270-agartala-slum-residents-get-flats-under-affordable-housing-scheme/135394556?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-240476/135394556.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Odisha REAT upholds \u20b990 lakh penalty on Puri developer, sets aside demolition", "para": "Odisha Real Estate Appellate Tribunal confirmed a Rs 90 lakh penalty for a developer violating construction plans. The developer built a G+10 structure instead of the approved G+7 residential project at Sipasarubali. The tribunal noted that mandatory approvals were not obtained for the revised plan submitted. However, it ruled that the demolition order issued by Orera exceeded jurisdiction.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/odisha-reat-upholds-90-lakh-penalty-on-puri-developer-sets-aside-demolition/135394383?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-103/135394383.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}, {"title": "LIC Housing Finance\u2019s net profit rises 12% to \u20b91,506.59 crore in Q2 FY27", "para": "In Q2 FY27, LIC Housing Finance